00:11:09,659 --> 00:11:12,960
JUAN ESHYN DY GEAR COOATYN COONTEY JEHN COVERINGS

214
00:11:12,960 --> 00:11:14,970
AYD RISH CALLIAN ELLAN AS SAVEEN

215
00:11:16,320 --> 00:11:19,530
VAN VENAEG VOGHE FO VOLLAGH VEH ORRYM STRAVAAGEY

216
00:11:21,059 --> 00:11:24,240
UN CHEAYRT FODDEE REN MISH NOGALLACH TREE FEED

217
00:11:24,240 --> 00:11:25,529
CHEEAD AS THREE JEIG

218
00:11:27,120 --> 00:11:29,250
REN AD REAGHEY Y CHOOISH CHEUMOOIE JEHN WHAIYL

219
00:11:29,250 --> 00:11:33,149
DOOGHYSSAGH HOOAR KELLY NY LHIE CASHTAL AYNS OIEVINGO

220
00:11:33,149 --> 00:11:36,389
VOISH THIE MYSH STORM AYNS YN ELVEEISH SMOO

221
00:11:36,389 --> 00:11:39,029
SCANSHOIL NA SHEN VAN CAART CURJEE ISH AS

222
00:11:39,029 --> 00:11:40,919
DYN REIREYDER NOA EC Y VEN MY HEE

223
00:11:41,340 --> 00:11:43,259
DY CHLOIE HENE AS OOILLEY NY MRAANE PRINS

224
00:11:43,259 --> 00:11:46,980
ELLEY AYNS NY FILMYN AS FEILL CORRYM CHA

225
00:11:46,980 --> 00:11:49,230
ROW VEG JEHN VOGHTYNID SHEN LESH FEILL SMOO

226
00:11:49,230 --> 00:11:51,299
EC MRAANE CHOUD'S VA MISH Y DOARNEYR ECK

227
00:11:52,950 --> 00:11:55,409
AS MYR SHOH TA COCHLEANAGH DY VE MAYNREY

228
00:11:55,409 --> 00:11:58,199
DY BRAGH BEAYN MANNAGH VEL OO DYS REN

229
00:11:58,200 --> 00:12:01,259
SCHLEI BRING LESH Y SOOREE ROISH MY VEES

230
00:12:01,259 --> 00:12:04,920
RODDAN ER MYR TURNEYR VER GAELG LESH ROBAIGYN

231
00:12:05,610 --> 00:12:06,240
RHYM PENE

232
00:12:11,850 --> 00:12:14,910
CHYNDAAYS RUSHEN JEH SKEEAL LIORISH TED MAGHAL AYNSHOH

233
00:12:15,269 --> 00:12:17,849
AS VEE ENMYSSIT MAYNREY DY BRAGH BEAYN

234
00:12:18,960 --> 00:12:21,360
BEE TOOILLEY DOARNEYRYS AYNS Y NAH VOD HOOLYNNAGH

235
00:12:21,480 --> 00:12:24,060
CAITNIS SHIRREY EH VOISH ABBYR SHEN REESHT C'RAAD

236
00:12:24,059 --> 00:12:24,329
NEE OO

237
00:12:34,169 --> 00:12:37,409
ISAIAH BERLIN VEIH'N NAH

238
00:12:39,600 --> 00:12:42,600
PHOSSAN AYNS UN LAA VEAGH ENMYSSIT

239
00:12:43,830 --> 00:12:46,169
ANANIAS HESHEYTROAILTAGH ALTERNATIVE

240
00:12:48,149 --> 00:12:50,190
LESH Y GHAELG OO HENE AS DTY HIE

241
00:12:50,190 --> 00:12:56,279
FEED ATCHIN HASS PAUL SHOH IS IT IS

242
00:12:56,279 --> 00:12:58,649
LAA HIE YN PHOSSAN SHOH

243
00:13:02,279 --> 00:13:03,389
LHISAGH EH RISHYN TA THIE

